 146:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c **** 
 147:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c ****   /* The function is internally
 148:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c ****    * divided into three parts according to the number of multiplications that has to be
 149:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c ****    * taken place between inputA samples and inputB samples. In the first part of the
 150:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c ****    * algorithm, the multiplications increase by one for every iteration.
 151:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_q15.c ****    * In the second part of the algorithm, srcBLen number of multiplications are done.
